OL,3,GFEATURESC1968 ITV changes: beginning of
OL,4,Ca golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week marks the 55th anniversary of
OL,7,Fwhat was probably the single biggest
OL,8,Fshake up in the history of the ITV
OL,9,Fnetwork.
OL,11,FIn 1968, all of the big regions
OL,12,Funderwent significant ` sometimes
OL,13,Fdramatic ` changes.
OL,15,FIn London, Thames and London Weekend
OL,16,Fwent on the air for the first time.
OL,18,FIn the north, Yorkshire took control of
OL,19,Fthe service east of the Pennines.
OL,23,APub: 30-Jul-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1968 ITV changes: beginning of
OL,4,Ca golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FElsewhere Granada lost much of its
OL,7,Fterritory but gained a greater focus,
OL,8,Fserving its Lancashire heartland
OL,9,F7-days-a-week.
OL,11,FMeanwhile ATV started to broadcast
OL,12,F7-days-a-week to the Midlands.
OL,14,FA few weeks earlier Harlech, later to
OL,15,Frebrand as HTV, took over the service
OL,16,Fin Wales and the West.
OL,18,FThese changes affected far more people
OL,19,Fthan the 1982 and 1993 shake-ups.
OL,23,APub: 30-Jul-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
