PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1968 ITV changes: beginning of
OL,4,Ca golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FViewers across most of England and all
OL,7,Fof Wales gained a new contractor or saw
OL,8,Fnotable changes to the existing one.
OL,10,FThere were also notable changes to the
OL,11,Fnetwork service.
OL,13,FThere were a number of different
OL,14,Fmotivations behind the changes made by
OL,15,Fthe regulator the ITA.
OL,17,FFirst ` they all but abandoned the idea
OL,18,Fof direct public competition between
OL,19,Fthe ITV companies.
OL,23,APub: 30-Jul-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13904
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1968 ITV changes: beginning of
OL,4,Ca golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutside London, each company was to be
OL,7,Fthe lord and master of its franchise
OL,8,Farea.
OL,10,FLondon retained two companies in order
OL,11,Fto prevent one from dominating the
OL,12,Fwhole system.
OL,14,FThe second was a new focus on
OL,15,Fregionalism. The changes were expected
OL,16,Fto lead to better local services ` a
OL,17,Ftighter focus on the north west and
OL,18,FYorkshire, a regional news service for
OL,19,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 30-Jul-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13905
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC1968 ITV changes: beginning of
OL,4,Ca golden age
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd thirdly the ITA was making it very
OL,7,Fclear to the ITV companies that they
OL,8,Fwere tenants ` not owners. They could
OL,9,Fbe dismissed by the regulator.
OL,11,FThe ITA was clear in its belief that
OL,12,FITV could provide just as good a public
OL,13,Fservice as the BBC and hoped the
OL,14,Fchanges would do that.
OL,16,FLondon Weekend in particular promised
OL,17,Fmuch in its franchise application.
OL,19,FThe initial results were patchy.
OL,20,FIndustrial action caused chaos.
OL,23,APub: 30-Jul-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
